H('315.d.1.C',3,"Which routine best supports a teacher's long-term wellness?","Regular exercise, sleep, and nutritious meals",["Skipping lunch to grade","Relying on energy drinks","Working through weekends"],"Basic health habits sustain energy.")
H('315.d.1.C',4,"Using a planner to spread grading across the week helps a teacher manage:","workload stress",["student attendance","bus duty","fire drills"],"Planning prevents last-minute overload.")
